// Embeds mdnote.ico as the .exe's own icon (Explorer, taskbar, Alt-Tab,
// and what the installer script picks up for shortcuts) -- without a
// resource like this, a Windows executable has no icon of its own at
// all. IDI_APPICON is just a resource name; being the first (only) ICON
// resource in the file is what makes Windows treat it as the exe's
// default icon.
IDI_APPICON ICON "mdnote.ico"
